ontent": "le couple", "type": "name"}, {"content": "deux personnes r\u00e9unies par des liens affectifs", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ils ont \u00e9t\u00e9 un couple extraordinaire.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le06ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Le pass\u00e9 compos\u00e9 des verbes \u00caTRE et NA\u00ceTRE \u00e0 la forme n\u00e9gative", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Comme vous le savez d\u00e9j\u00e0, on emploie les particules <span class=\"strong\">ne</span> et <span class=\"strong\">pas</span> pour former des phrases n\u00e9gatives.<ul><li>Au pass\u00e9 compos\u00e9, on place la particule <span class=\"strong\">ne <span class=\"product-color-text\">AVANT</span></span> l'auxiliaire <span class=\"strong\">avoir</span> ou <span class=\"strong\">\u00eatre</span>. On place la particule <span class=\"strong\">pas <span class=\"product-color-text\">APR\u00c8S</span></span> l'auxiliaire <span class=\"strong\">avoir</span> ou <span class=\"strong\">\u00eatre.</span></li></ul></br> Le tableau ci-dessous donne la conjugaison des verbes <span class=\"strong\">\u00eatre</span> et <span class=\"strong\">na\u00eetre</span> \u00e0 la forme n\u00e9gative du pass\u00e9 compos\u00e9.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Anne</span> : Tu n'as pas \u00e9t\u00e9 au cirque pendant le week-end ?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Olivier</span> : Non, je n'ai pas \u00e9t\u00e9 au cirque pendant le week-end.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Marie</span> : Vous n'\u00eates pas n\u00e9s en France ?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Pierre et Paul</span> : Non, nous ne sommes pas n\u00e9s en France. Nous sommes n\u00e9s en Suisse.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">\u00caTRE au pass\u00e9 compos\u00e9</br>\u00e0 la forme n\u00e9gative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">NA\u00ceTRE au pass\u00e9 compos\u00e9</br>\u00e0 la forme n\u00e9gative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"je <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">n'</span>ai <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">pas</span> \u00e9t\u00e9</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"je <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">ne</span> suis <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">pas</span> n\u00e9(e)</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tu <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">n'</span>as <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">pas</span> \u00e9t\u00e9</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"tu <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">n'</span>es <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">pas</span> n\u00e9(e)</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"il <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">n'</span>a <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">pas</span> \u00e9t\u00e9</div></br>elle <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">n'</span>a <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">pas</span> \u00e9t\u00e9</div></br>on<span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">n'</span>a <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">pas</span> \u00e9t\u00e9</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"il <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">n'</span>est <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">pas</span> n\u00e9 </br>elle <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">n'</span>est <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">pas</span> n\u00e9e</br>on <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">n'</span>est <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">pas</span> n\u00e9</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"nous <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">n'</span>avons <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">pas</span> \u00e9t\u00e9</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"nous <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">ne</span> sommes <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">pas</span> n\u00e9(e)s</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"vous <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">n'</span>avez <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">pas</span> \u00e9t\u00e9</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"vous <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">n'</span>\u00eates <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">pas</span> n\u00e9(e)s</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ils/elles <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">n'</span>ont <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">pas</span> \u00e9t\u00e9</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ils <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">ne</span> sont <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">pas</span> n\u00e9s </br>elles <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">ne</span> sont <span class=\\\"product-color-text\\\">pas</span> n\u00e9es</div>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Parler du pays d'origine et de la nationalit\u00e9 des gens", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Pour parler des pays o\u00f9 les gens sont n\u00e9s, on emploie :</br><ul><li>Le verbe <span class=\"strong\">na\u00eetre</span> au pass\u00e9 compos\u00e9 ;</br><li>Des noms de pays comme <span class=\"italic\">la Belgique</span>, <span class=\"italic\">la Suisse</span> ou <span class=\"italic\">la France</span> ;<br /><li>Des adjectifs de nationalit\u00e9 comme <span class=\"italic\">belge</span>, <span class=\"italic\">suisse</span> ou <span class=\"italic\">fran\u00e7ais(e)</span>.></li></ul></br> Le tableau ci-dessous liste plusieurs noms de pays et de r\u00e9gions francophones, de m\u00eame que les nationalit\u00e9s correspondantes. Il montre aussi des suffixes qu'on emploie souvent pour former des adjectifs de nationalit\u00e9 \u00e0 partir des noms de pays.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Pays ou r\u00e9gion\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Nationalit\u00e9\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Suffixe\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"la Belgique<br />la Suisse\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"belge (m./f.)<br /> suisse (m./f.)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"-e\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"la France<br />la R\u00e9union\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"fran\u00e7ais (m.), fran\u00e7aise (f.)</br> r\u00e9unionnais (m.), r\u00e9unionnaise (f.) \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"-ais (m.), -aise (f.)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"le Qu\u00e9bec</br> le Luxembourg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"qu\u00e9b\u00e9cois (m.), qu\u00e9b\u00e9coise (f.)</br>luxembourgeois (m.), luxembourgeoise (f.)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"-ois (m.), -oise (f.)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"la Guadeloupe</br> l'\u00cele Maurice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"guadeloup\u00e9en (m.), guadeloup\u00e9enne (f.)</br>mauricien (m.), mauricienne (f.)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"-en (m.), -enne (f.)\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Isabelle</span> : Mon arri\u00e8re-grand-m\u00e8re est n\u00e9e en Suisse. Elle \u00e9tait suisse.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Jean</span> : Mon arri\u00e8re-grand-p\u00e8re \u00e9tait qu\u00e9b\u00e9cois. Il est n\u00e9 au Qu\u00e9bec.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "premier, premi\u00e8re", "type": "name"}, {"content": "qui pr\u00e9c\u00e8de les autres dans le temps", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Elle a \u00e9t\u00e9 la premi\u00e8re femme m\u00e9decin de son pays.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn1le06ob02aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "L'apprenant \u00e9change de l'information personnelle simple.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "L'apprenant fournit de l'information personnelle simple \u00e0 l'\u00e9crit et \u00e0 l'oral avec des phrases simples et compr\u00e9hensibles.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "L'apprenant comprend l'information \u00e9l\u00e9mentaire des textes en fran\u00e7ais, qui correspond au sujet communicatif de ce niveau. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "L'apprenant comprend l'information \u00e9l\u00e9mentaire des textes en fran\u00e7ais, qui correspond au sujet communicatif de ce niveau. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "L'apprenant fournit de l'information personnelle simple \u00e0 l'\u00e9crit et \u00e0 l'oral avec des phrases simples et compr\u00e9hensibles.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "L'apprenant fournit de l'information personnelle simple \u00e0 l'\u00e9crit et \u00e0 l'oral avec des phrases simples et compr\u00e9hensibles.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "L'apprenant fournit de l'information personnelle simple \u00e0 l'\u00e9crit et \u00e0 l'oral avec des phrases simples et compr\u00e9hensibles.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "L'apprenant comprend l'information \u00e9l\u00e9mentaire des textes en fran\u00e7ais, qui correspond au sujet communicatif de ce niveau. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "L'apprenant fournit de l'information personnelle simple \u00e0 l'\u00e9crit et \u00e0 l'oral avec des phrases simples et compr\u00e9hensibles.", "type": "secondary_8"}]